  "historyNote": "#7731, eff 7-26-02 (See Revision Note #2 at Chapter Heading for Saf-C 3200) (formerly Saf-C 3223.05); ss and renumbered by #9184, eff 6-20-08 (from Saf-C 3222.04); ss by #11016, eff 1-6-16",
